(Penny:)but turning water into wine
sounds pretty good.

6
00:00:16,715 --> 00:00:19,955
(Sheldon:)I don't think you're
taking this seriously.

7
00:00:19,952 --> 00:00:21,682
(Penny:)Come on, I'm just having
some fun with you.

8
00:00:21,687 --> 00:00:22,717
(Sheldon:)I believe

9
00:00:22,721 --> 00:00:24,921
what you're doing is using humor

10
